Package: treesatnemeton
Title: TreeSatAI-Time-Series - Forest Species Classification from Sentinel-2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pascal", "Obstetar", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pascal.obstetar@gmail.com")
Description: Classification of 10 European forest species groups (20 species
    regrouped) using multi-year Sentinel-1/2 time series and phenological
    signatures. Based on the TreeSatAI-Time-Series dataset (IGNF). Supports
    Random Forest and deep learning (PyTorch) models with Boruta feature
    selection and class weighting, automatic satellite data download from
    Microsoft Planetary Computer, and spatial prediction on any area of
    interest (AOI).
